  "releaseNotes": "3.6.2\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.8.0\n      3.6.1\n      Bug fix for eInvoice units.json\n      3.6.0\n      Switched to auto package references\n      3.5.4\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.7.3 (removes SSL verification, fixes comments in eFatura)\n      3.5.3\n      updated Fiscalization package to 2.7.1 (fixes package loading)\n      3.5.2\n      Updated Fiscalization Package to 2.6.2 (XMLSerializer caching)\n      3.5.1\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.6.1 (fixes cert loading on net472)\n      3.5.0\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.6.0 (improves http client connections)\n      3.4.1\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.5.1 (exposes cert cache clearing)\n      3.4.0\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.5.0 (adds Certificate caching)\n      3.3.0\n      Added logging level configuration\n      3.2.1\n      Updated fiscalization package 2.4.3 (for cert loading)\n      3.2.0\n      Updated Fiscalization package to 2.4.0 (adds Project Reference in eInvoExt)\n      3.1.1\n      Updated Fiscalisation package to 2.3.2\n      3.1.0\n      Updated Fiscalisation package to 2.2.0 (removed dependency on SFL)\n      3.0.0\n      Added support for net 8.0\n      2.2.0\n      Add config for ShfaqKopje\n      2.1.0\n      Add config for RetryTimeout\n      2.0.0\n      Add config for QRMode printing",
